            <div xml:id="d362">

                <pb facs="0610" n="498" xml:id="pg498"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5727/75.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the British
                    Chargé</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-07-09"><hi rendition="#italic">July 9,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to your personal note of July 3, have just received from Treasury
                    Department a note stating that in view of the facts set forth, no objection is
                    perceived to the extension of the privilege requested. Copy of note in due
                    course by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
